Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's currently in a deep REM\Nsleep and has been for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,he woke up in a posture like an\Nascetic monk and when it seemed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,like he might be awake he went\Nback to sleep for 24 hours makes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,sense since he has zero memory\Nto speak of how are his learning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and cognitive skills after\Nbeing revived they're all normal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,he's even memorized 30\Nenglish words however
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he doesn't seem to know\Nor understand his name
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,is Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As for his family, he shows no reaction,\Nnot even to a picture of his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,His EEG and EKG read is normal too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,However, his muscle\Nvalues are on the decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Having no memories would\Nindicate that he naturally has
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,no motivation to go on living\Nas the mind is shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In response, the muscles\Nbegin to deteriorate quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have no other choice here than\Nto try and get his memories back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.74,0:01:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him some first aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to warn you about that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just release his stand power? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's actually not from his\Nmemory, but rather an instinctive defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It says Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It couldn't possibly say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always incredibly\Nimportant to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the wounds on your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I treated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I healed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.18,0:02:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They've formed shapes\Nthat spell something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try healing them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to heal this. I have no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,way to explain it but I know this is a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,message sent from my dad\Nsince before I was even born
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:03:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that man has been watching over\Nso many things to keep mama
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and I from being involved in\Nscenarios exactly like the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,ones that are going on right\Nnow he made sure to keep his
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,distance, knowing that\Nit helped me stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that through my\Nbody, my dad speaks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the only one to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming here. I don't\Neven know what I can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the path that I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the world is lost. We are\Nin the world. We are in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop waiting. Don't stop\Nbeating, don't stop beating a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that I want her to trip,\Nbut it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't actually allow her to fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, as soon as she stumbles, I'm\Ngoing to catch her in my arms. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, she might not understand that\Nshe was protected earlier because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What I desire is to feel\Nher in my embrace again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So go do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just trip her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sexual harassment and assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's on you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make Jolene my wife\Nand you are going to help me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,with that are you the sort of\Nperson who breaks their promises
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Jolene, but I have to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have been spying on us\Nfrom the floor above the whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's holding the bone\Nin his hand right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he sure is a slippery\Nlittle fucker, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But he won't escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You said earlier that he was a small\Nman, right? He indeed fit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,category before but now he's somehow\Nsunbathing getting much taller before
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.22,0:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,our eyes as tall as me no even\Ntaller in fact hey you're cornered no
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,more running away now face me nice
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and slow feels good the sun The light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.12,0:06:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm talking to you,\Nasshole! Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Light is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone gathers here, and it's so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His head literally just exploded!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't look like a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is, but whatever\Nwe do, we shouldn't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, where'd the bone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He was holding it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happening to the other inmates, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're undeniably turning into plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They appear to still be\Ngrowing, too. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What possible reason could anyone have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should think of\Nthis as a stand power as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like the power and\Nwill fueling this phenomenon is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,in so doing attempting to give\Nlife to something entirely new.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Flowers bloomed, as well as stems\Nleaves even a tiny little trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And at the end of that, well then what\Nshould I do with the bone that the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,small man dropped this is a conundrum\Ni now know that it's dangerous to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,touch the bone to say nothing of\Ntouching anyone else who's come into
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:09:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact with it. Stop right there,\NJolyne Kujo! Don't go any further!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around and look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see your face, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to check something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, you pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All the prisoners at this discipline\Nward became like this due to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not an enemy stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy would have used their power\Nto attack us first if that were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, Jolene, I thought\Nthat a bit earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With your thread looking the way it\Ndid, that you would touch the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The bone! It's rolling away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been infected, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive or drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia! Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick it all out from inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not finished yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not correct or proper to say\Nyank it out or it's growing, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The body is actually being\Ntransformed into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be able to simply rip these off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, any pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but this is still bad news,\Nbecause it means I touched that bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more, since I'm turning floral,\Nyou'd better stay far away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You might get infected also.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is simply a plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but I do know that instead of blood running\Nthrough your veins, there's chlorophyll.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know, I'm going to do\Nsomething about it, without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sunlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stay in the shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go towards or in the\Nsunlight, it grows fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you move back into the\Nshade, the growth calms down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing's purpose, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea, but I've\Ngot to get that bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing that matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are you going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You touch it again, and you'll\Nturn into a frickin' tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:11:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm picking it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I already am one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I said to stay out of the sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The bone. Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm right, it should have rolled over\Nhere and ended up by this flower by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that a star?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this bruise-like thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see something showing\Nthrough from behind it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, it's a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A green child!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrots that are shaped like\NSnoopy and radishes that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,look like big tits get harvested\Nfrom farms all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be like that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it definitely looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No more Jolene don't\Neven think about touching
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that thing get back here\Nnow Haven't you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The roots are wrapping around\Nyour leg and meshing with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a plant or is it a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It turned the whole Discipline\NWard into a greenhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,connected them by its roots, then bloomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This weird little fruit baby probably\Nabsorbed the bone when it was germinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And Palesnake is here somewhere inside\Nthis prison to find out what's behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What will come out of this pod?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here because he wants to know\Nwhat begins when it's finally born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I said get back here, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is setting in the west, so the\Nlight's getting stronger and hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't step back,\Nit's going to get bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.92,0:13:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're picking that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I would say it's more like stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let Pale Snake get\Nhis filthy hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.62,0:14:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner we get you away\Nfrom sunlight, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.43,0:14:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, hang on, this building's\Nexit is west-facing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how we're gonna\Nget out of this shithole.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's at least one more\Nenemy sand user here somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,which means we're still in big-ass danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.87,0:14:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After everyone drowned, they\Nturned into grass and died!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought it turned into grass too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here! Fine, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,First, tell me your name,\Nand are you hurt at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck, Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize he could be an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an enemy and not telling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Guccio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't want to become grass, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I already said it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up, Guchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can at least do that, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans have 12 pairs of ribs, 24 in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of people's\Ngender, weight, or height.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So is that guy an enemy or isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, that's of no\Nimportance to me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm interested\Nin now is if we can safely
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,get out of here from the\Neast side of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We should want safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,we should make that our exit point
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,i didn't expect the green\Nchild how did it ever
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,come to this i had only\Nthe barest of information
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,i have one job and it's simple\Nget rid of jolene kujo permanently
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that's all i'm here for i just\Nhave to make sure i do that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Jolene and\Nthose other two fools go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they possibly manage to\Nescape and I missed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way they could get\Noutside without my seeing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the other three?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And why haven't you\Nturned into a plant yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in agony!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They modified a human\Nbody into a death trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt such pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My left arm is useless now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an awful experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tailed Snake told me to make\Nthem fight using Survivor,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm pretty sure I did that, but\Nwhat really matters now is, yay,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,finally, I could go\Noutside and be in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close, but it looks like we made\Na clean getaway from the other stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's withering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it was a temporary thing anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The bigger problem to worry\Nabout is that at any minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,prison staffers are going to realize\Nwhat happened at this discipline ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better for us, because if they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.14,0:18:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Palesnake will realize\Nthat at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll come out and show his ugly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Which then gives me the best chance\Nto take my dad's memory disc back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cholene, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an enemy stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably the one that\Nbelongs to that guy playing army!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He took the fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger, drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This body...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.21,0:19:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My god, ew, the stench of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying, but I can't get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten close enough\Nto feel the stand itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that repulsive\Nodor is coming from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they that dirty because of what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My, I'm embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, please have a seat on this chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let your shoes clean for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,would you like to read the manga\NI swiped from the guards' room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, there's a bee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you about my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, his name is D and G.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The last I saw him, he was\Nin the discipline ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,His left arm was a bleeding mess, and\Nhe was bawling like a helpless baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a Long Range Control Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's plenty to take the fruit\Nand run back to its master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be out here in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, we have to get\Nout of here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the marshland.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There might be a boat or at\Nleast a water scooter there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's how to differentiate\Nwild strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The yellow one is only a mock\Nstrawberry. So you really can't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you ever shut the\Nfuck up? Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave that stand where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.74,0:20:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He swallowed the green plant, baby And\Nwe have to get it out of him like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, tell that weirdo we\Nhave to take him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to go find the main body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you do, blow him off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So I should go along with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right, Master? Goody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the exclusive\NMarshland boat, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a special propeller\Npowered by the wind to sail it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be surprised how fast it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.09,0:21:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I start it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it locked on this boat somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the throttle lever, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get it in gear, you must\Nshift it in neutral first, like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.76,0:21:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The stick is the rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Push it forward, the empanage,\Nor tail assembly turns right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it back, it turns to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple as that. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, untie the anchor rope, weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, right away, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.16,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, don't you dare take\Nyour eyes off that stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you've got him under your\Nwatch, he'll be an excellent servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.14,0:21:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's creepy, but he'll be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:22:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if you give him any leeway...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.56,0:22:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is way worse than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.87,0:22:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.79,0:22:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take your eyes off\Nthis monster for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.78,0:22:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than he
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.06,0:22:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.26,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,inside and all the while,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.42,0:22:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.62,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.66,0:24:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
